# Canonical identity for this project's history.
#
# Author has committed under three addresses over the life of the repo: the
# GitHub no-reply address, a personal address, and (for two early commits, since
# rewritten) an employer address. Everything resolves to the no-reply address,
# which keeps a personal inbox out of a public repo while still tying commits to
# the GitHub account.
#
# git respects this in log, shortlog, blame, and `shortlog -sne`.

